            "review_title": "Review at Ding Dimsum",
            "review_text": "iceblended\nSingapore, Singapore1666 contributions\n0\nNice comfort Chinese food\nDec 2024 • Family\nWr chance upon this outlet as we craved for tim sum.\n\nFood selection is good and reasonable priced.\n\nChinese tea was not available, only can drinks were available.\n\nFood were freshly made in the kitchen at level 1. Seating were available at level 2. Menu in Vietnamese and self order through staff. \n\nWorth going.\nRead more\nWritten December 27, 2024",
